# The Vercel BUILD needs the generators, requirements, and the committed
# history/state JSON — so those are uploaded. Only the rendered HTML in dist/
# is actually served (see vercel.json outputDirectory), so nothing else here is
# exposed. We still refuse to upload secrets, as defense in depth.

# ── SECRETS — never upload ────────────────────────────────
google_credentials.json
google_token.json
service_account.json
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
service_account*.json
secrets*.json

# ── Not needed by the build ───────────────────────────────
*.gs
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ── OS junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
